{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00952","headline":"横吹曲辞 出塞 · 耿[湋]","name":"横吹曲辞 出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家边事重，窦宪出临戎。\n绝漠秋山在，阳关旧路通。\n列营依茂草，吹角向高风。\n更就燕然石，看铭破虏功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿[湋]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}